<section class="tk-price"><div class="tk-shell">
<div class="tk-price-hero"><span class="tk-ip-kicker">TRACEKIT PLANS & PRICING</span><h1>Powerful intelligence.<br><em>Built to scale with your business.</em></h1><p>One connected view of your clicks, customers, and dollars. Choose the plan that fits your brands—or the independent advertisers you manage. Your core reporting and reconciliation tools shouldn't disappear behind higher tiers.</p><div class="tk-price-hero-actions"><a class="btn" href="#tk-price-plans">Explore Plans ↓</a><span>No per-user, per-offer, or per-connector charges.</span></div></div>
<div class="tk-price-founding"><div><span class="tk-ip-kicker">FOUNDING CUSTOMER PROGRAM</span><h2>Become a TraceKit Founding Customer.</h2><p>Get exclusive founding-customer pricing for your first 12 months. Limited to the first 20 approved customers. Rates then transition to regular pricing under the final customer agreement.</p><small>Availability and acceptance are subject to approval. No live subscription is activated by applying.</small></div><a class="btn" href="/pages/book-a-demo">Apply for Founding Access →</a></div>
<div id="tk-price-plans" class="tk-price-section-title"><span class="tk-ip-kicker">FIND YOUR FIT</span><h2>Simple plans. Room to grow.</h2><p>Advertiser plans scale primarily by brand count. Agency is designed for independent advertiser clients.</p></div>
<div class="tk-price-grid"><article class="tk-price-card "><div class="tk-price-plan">Starter</div><p class="tk-price-desc">For advertisers operating one brand.</p><div class="tk-price-price"><strong>$199</strong><span>/month founding</span></div><div class="tk-price-regular">Regularly $299/month</div><div class="tk-price-capacity">1 brand</div><a class="btn tk-price-card-cta" href="/pages/book-a-demo">Apply for Founding Access →</a><ul><li>Unlimited supported connections</li><li>Unlimited offers and team members</li><li>Customer journeys and attribution</li><li>Commerce and profitability reporting</li><li>Refunds and reconciliation</li></ul></article>
<article class="tk-price-card tk-price-popular"><span class="tk-price-recommend">POPULAR FOR MULTI-BRAND TEAMS</span><div class="tk-price-plan">Growth</div><p class="tk-price-desc">For advertisers growing across brands.</p><div class="tk-price-price"><strong>$399</strong><span>/month founding</span></div><div class="tk-price-regular">Regularly $599/month</div><div class="tk-price-capacity">Up to 3 brands</div><a class="btn tk-price-card-cta" href="/pages/book-a-demo">Apply for Founding Access →</a><ul><li>Everything in Starter</li><li>Cross-brand reporting</li><li>Multi-brand Mission Control</li><li>Priority support</li></ul></article>
<article class="tk-price-card "><div class="tk-price-plan">Scale</div><p class="tk-price-desc">For established performance-marketing teams.</p><div class="tk-price-price"><strong>$699</strong><span>/month founding</span></div><div class="tk-price-regular">Regularly $999/month</div><div class="tk-price-capacity">Up to 10 brands</div><a class="btn tk-price-card-cta" href="/pages/book-a-demo">Apply for Founding Access →</a><ul><li>Everything in Growth</li><li>Larger organizational scale</li><li>Priority onboarding and support</li></ul></article>
<article class="tk-price-card "><div class="tk-price-plan">Agency</div><p class="tk-price-desc">For agencies managing independent advertiser clients.</p><div class="tk-price-price"><strong>$999</strong><span>/month founding</span></div><div class="tk-price-regular">Regularly $1299/month</div><div class="tk-price-capacity">Up to 5 client advertisers</div><a class="btn tk-price-card-cta" href="/pages/book-a-demo">Apply for Founding Access →</a><ul><li>Separate client environments</li><li>Client-level access and permissions</li><li>Agency portfolio visibility</li><li>Client context switching</li><li>Core reporting and reconciliation</li></ul></article></div>
<div class="tk-price-note">All prices shown in USD per month. Founding rates apply to approved founding customers for 12 months, subject to final agreement. Feature availability depends on production readiness and supported connections. Fair-use protections apply.</div>
<div class="tk-price-enterprise"><div><span class="tk-ip-kicker">CUSTOM SOLUTIONS</span><h2>Enterprise</h2><p>For larger advertisers, agencies, networks, and organizations with complex data, access, or infrastructure requirements. Let's scope your brand/client capacity, integrations, onboarding, and commercial needs together.</p><small>Enterprise capabilities and service commitments are confirmed individually; no unverified SSO, infrastructure, or SLA promises.</small></div><a class="btn" href="/pages/book-a-demo">Contact Sales →</a></div>
<div class="tk-price-section-title"><span class="tk-ip-kicker">THE CORE DOESN'T CHANGE</span><h2>Every plan starts with connected evidence.</h2></div>
<div class="tk-price-benefits"><div><strong>Unlimited supported connections</strong><p>Connect available sources without buying connector add-ons.</p></div><div><strong>Unlimited offers and users</strong><p>Organize offers and teams without per-seat or per-offer fees.</p></div><div><strong>Commerce and profitability</strong><p>Track journeys, orders, refunds, chargebacks, and financial outcomes.</p></div><div><strong>Reconciliation and visibility</strong><p>Investigate linked records, discrepancies, and unresolved evidence.</p></div></div>
<p class="tk-price-availability">Mission Control, alerts, Intelligence, MCP, and other capabilities are offered according to their verified production availability and account permissions. Plan descriptions do not imply unreleased features are active today.</p>
<div class="tk-price-section-title"><span class="tk-ip-kicker">GOOD TO KNOW</span><h2>Pricing questions, answered.</h2></div>
<div class="tk-price-faq">
<details><summary>What counts as a brand?</summary><p>A brand is a distinct commercial business identity operating its own products or offers. Multiple domains, campaigns, and offers for that business do not automatically count as separate brands. The final definition is subject to entitlement validation.</p></details>
<details><summary>Are connections, offers, or team members limited?</summary><p>There are no per-connector, per-offer, or per-user charges. Connections must be supported and available for your environment, and reasonable fair-use protections apply.</p></details>
<details><summary>How does founding pricing work?</summary><p>The first 20 approved founding customers are eligible for their plan's founding rate for 12 months. After that, the applicable regular rate applies under the final agreement. Approval and availability are not guaranteed.</p></details>
<details><summary>How is Agency different?</summary><p>Agency supports multiple independent advertiser clients, with separate client data and permissions. Pricing for additional clients and brand allowances per client will be confirmed before contracting.</p></details>
<details><summary>Can I subscribe immediately?</summary><p>Not yet through this page. Apply for founding access or speak with our team. Billing and account entitlements will be activated only through an approved onboarding process.</p></details>
</div>
<div class="tk-price-final"><div><h2>Know where every dollar goes.</h2><p>Let's find the right TraceKit plan for your business.</p></div><a class="btn" href="/pages/book-a-demo">Apply for Founding Access →</a></div>
</div></section>
